A||N||4||Seanh||Dual Exhaust on a Fiero?||||1||
Z||000000||Seanh||10-13-2001||10:19 PM||||Just wondering if anyone had tried true dual exhaust on a V6 Fiero? I'm thinking about doing it, but not sure if its ever worth my time...||||reg||1
Z||000001||California Kid||10-13-2001||10:24 PM||||Due to the different lenght require between front / rear bank, you'd still need a balance pipe connect between the two. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||WKDFIRO||10-14-2001||03:04 AM||||I have heard the noise of dual exhaust 3800 and I was disappointed. As it was explained to me, the unequal exhaust pulses create a small pop in the exhaust that almost sounds like a cylinder missing. I had read about a similar problem with the early Vipers before they improved the exhaust. <P>It almost seems to be taking a step forward and then taking two steps back to go dual exhaust then work out a crossover pipe. ||||reg||6
Z||000003||Fierowrecker||10-14-2001||10:11 AM||||Back a few years ago, someone came up with a six into one header that sounded very good, and added HP...<BR>But you need lots of room to build such a header...<BR>Your other choice is to have an X pipe to balance the flow...<BR>A balance pipe even helps the V8 headers work better...<P>------------------<BR>crash... The Fierowrecker<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/uploads/crash_sig.jpg">          <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Fierowrecker (edited 10-14-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||10-14-2001||10:57 AM||||I've gone for a ride in a built up 2.8 (87 GT, 5spd) with a true dual exhaust. custom headers, 2 cats, and resonator tips.. it could break the tires loose in 3rd, and we launched from an intersection in 4th.. felt the same as an auto at 3/4 throttle or so.. it was awesome.. and the sound was incredible. This car was at a couple of the Grand Bend meets this sumnmer, though the owner isn't on the forum.<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||14
